You say later that you already have three lamps. In my mind, that's the
breaking point; you have enough light to get you to the point where you
don't care anymore. Burn the wish; MR protects you from things that 
nothing else does. Reflection mitigates this --- with reflection I won't
use the wish as readily --- but since you have plenty of light already,
I think it's the way to go. 

(And yes, it might be the way to go all the time, but if I have MR and/or
reflection and no other light source I'll usually keep the light source
until I'm done with the Mines; having light down there is really nice,
but in the main dungeon I don't mind darkness so much.) 

